},"saturday-delivery",{"titleTag":8,"metaDescription":9,"canonical":10,"subpath1":11,"subpath2":21,"slices":22},"Saturday Parcel Courier & Delivery Service | Evri","We can help you find a Saturday parcel delivery option right for you. Send, receive and return parcels 7 days a week with Evri’s courier service.","saturday-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fsaturday-delivery",{"id":12,"type":13,"tags":14,"lang":15,"slug":16,"first_publication_date":17,"last_publication_date":17,"uid":16,"link_type":18,"key":19,"isBroken":20},"YhjzRRIAAC8A3CHH","subpath1",[],"en-gb","our-services","2022-02-25T15:18:32+0000","Document","29f1126a-0aa0-4620-b9c8-300f9ae6a056",false,{"link_type":18},[23,45,96,151,211,285],{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":26,"primary":36,"id":42,"slice_type":43,"slice_label":44},"horizontalWidget","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[27],{"contentRight":28},{"id":29,"type":30,"tags":31,"lang":15,"slug":32,"first_publication_date":33,"last_publication_date":34,"link_type":18,"key":35,"isBroken":20},"ZgVcQRIAACEApjZD","form-v2",[],"from-2.62","2024-03-28T12:02:58+0000","2026-07-09T07:23:30+0000","6e55baac-ddb7-463a-ba58-a2a498e93be9",{"heading":37,"includeInternational":38,"desktopBackground":39,"tabletBackground":40,"mobileBackground":41},"Saturday delivery",true,{},{},{},"hero_banner$e511e437-4542-44b3-9c3a-52790f35e02e","hero_banner",null,{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":47,"primary":49,"id":94,"slice_type":95,"slice_label":44},"default-slice",[48],{},{"CardImage":50,"CardAvatar":62,"CardTitle":63,"CardText":64,"ButtonText":89,"ButtonUrl":90,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":51,"alt":54,"copyright":44,"url":55,"id":56,"edit":57},{"width":52,"height":53},1000,665,"An Evri Courier is handing two parcels to a father and child on their doorstep. They are laughing as if a joke or anecdote was exchanged.","saturday-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tjaJbqstJ9-fAI_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7142.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6tjaJbqstJ9-fAI",{"x":58,"y":59,"zoom":60,"background":61},0,8,1,"transparent","none","Send, receive and return parcels, including Saturday deliveries",[65,70],{"type":66,"text":67,"spans":68,"direction":69},"paragraph","Make use of the weekend for all your parcel sending needs with our Saturday delivery service. We have couriers working all day Saturday collecting and delivering your parcels to accommodate your schedule. Our ParcelShop and Locker drop-off network is also available all weekend ready for you to send, return or collect a parcel.",[],"ltr",{"type":66,"text":71,"spans":72,"direction":69},"Saturday schedule piling up? We also offer a Sunday courier service for total weekend coverage. Enjoy fast, reliable and convenient delivery with Evri.  ",[73,87],{"start":74,"end":75,"type":76,"data":77},45,67,"hyperlink",{"id":78,"type":79,"tags":80,"lang":15,"slug":82,"first_publication_date":83,"last_publication_date":84,"uid":85,"url":86,"link_type":18,"isBroken":20},"ZAn6sREAACIA5fou","content-page",[81],"Our Services","our-parcel-drop-off-network-is-open-7-days-a-week","2023-03-10T09:01:44+0000","2026-03-20T14:30:18+0000","sunday-delivery","\u002Four-services\u002Fsunday-delivery",{"start":74,"end":75,"type":88},"strong","Send a parcel this Saturday",{"link_type":91,"key":92,"url":93},"Web","3fa97422-835a-453c-a090-d79d24f423b1","saturday-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend","card$758b263c-3424-4758-9a14-cd84750d82ea","card",{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":97,"primary":139,"id":149,"slice_type":150,"slice_label":44},[98,119],{"Title":99,"Description":104,"Image":108,"Label":44,"UrlText":114,"Url":115,"buttonDataGtmTrack":44,"SecondaryButtonText":44,"SecondaryButtonUrl":117,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":44,"ShowAppDownloadCta":44},[100],{"type":101,"text":102,"spans":103,"direction":69},"heading3","Standard delivery without delay",[],[105],{"type":66,"text":106,"spans":107,"direction":69},"Send a parcel on a Saturday for as little as £2.62 for delivery in just 2-4 days. For your more important or valuable items, you can extend your parcel cover up to the value of £999. And, for just 60p extra, you can add a digital signature to your delivery, ensuring that it exchanges hands when it reaches its destination. Choose peace of mind for your deliveries. ",[],{"dimensions":109,"alt":110,"copyright":44,"url":111,"id":112,"edit":113},{"width":52,"height":53},"An Evri Courier is walking down the street in a residential area with a parcel under his arm.","saturday-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69xYZbqstJ9-pUz_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0687.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z69xYZbqstJ9-pUz",{"x":58,"y":59,"zoom":60,"background":61},"Send with Standard delivery today",{"link_type":91,"key":116,"url":93},"2f717c40-b4a1-42c5-8238-14a07363f05f",{"link_type":118},"Any",{"Title":120,"Description":124,"Image":128,"Label":44,"UrlText":134,"Url":135,"buttonDataGtmTrack":44,"SecondaryButtonText":44,"SecondaryButtonUrl":138,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":44,"ShowAppDownloadCta":44},[121],{"type":101,"text":122,"spans":123,"direction":69},"Choose Next Day Saturday delivery ",[],[125],{"type":66,"text":126,"spans":127,"direction":69},"If you drop-off your parcel before 12pm on Friday, we’ll move your parcel overnight so that it’s with your recipient on Saturday. Starting at £3.20, our Next Day service could be a lifesaver for your last-minute parcel delivery needs. If you’re dropping off your parcel on a Saturday, then it can take a little longer. In this case we would probably suggest using our Standard delivery instead, just to guarantee you get the best price for your delivery. ",[],{"dimensions":129,"alt":130,"copyright":44,"url":131,"id":132,"edit":133},{"width":52,"height":53},"A parcel in waterproof blue packaging is being handed to a recipient at the door. A blue Evri van can be seen in the background.","saturday-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y9MZbqstJ9-iHb_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9013.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6y9MZbqstJ9-iHb",{"x":58,"y":59,"zoom":60,"background":61},"Send a parcel Next Day",{"link_type":91,"key":136,"url":137},"bd3e674d-29a3-4fc1-8419-20112897206b","saturday-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fnext-day-parcel-delivery",{"link_type":118},{"SectionTitle":140,"SectionDescription":145,"theme":44},[141],{"type":142,"text":143,"spans":144,"direction":69},"heading2","Find your ideal Saturday delivery courier with Evri ",[],[146],{"type":66,"text":147,"spans":148,"direction":69},"Our Standard and Next Day delivery options are designed to save you money while ensuring your packages arrive when you need them. Choose the service that best fits your schedule and enjoy the convenience of timely deliveries, even on weekends!",[],"article_link_module$0de7bda3-8f64-4601-a049-8796125356d2","article_link_module",{"variation":152,"version":25,"items":153,"primary":154,"id":209,"slice_type":210,"slice_label":44},"fullWidthBanner",[],{"theme":155,"show_premium_logo":20,"label":44,"label_theme":156,"titleH2":157,"bodyText":158,"image":189,"rightImage":38,"buttonText":198,"buttonLink":199,"buttonDataGtmTrack":44,"primary_button_external":20,"button_secondary":208,"secondary_button_external":20},"standard","Core","A trusted courier service",[159,164,167,171,174,177,180,183,186],{"type":66,"text":160,"spans":161,"direction":69},"Why send with Evri?",[162],{"start":58,"end":163,"type":88},19,{"type":66,"text":165,"spans":166,"direction":69},"What may mark the end of the working week for many, is just another day of providing excellent service for Evri. Even on Saturday we’re able to provide incredible benefits for our customers and recipients for no extra cost. Check out just a few things that make Evri a superior delivery service:  ",[],{"type":168,"text":169,"spans":170,"direction":69},"list-item","End-to-end parcel tracking on our app or online ",[],{"type":168,"text":172,"spans":173,"direction":69},"A 1-hour delivery window so you know when to expect your courier ",[],{"type":168,"text":175,"spans":176,"direction":69},"Divert your parcel to a ParcelShop or Locker for peace of mind ",[],{"type":168,"text":178,"spans":179,"direction":69},"Give your courier delivery instructions by nominating a neighbour or safe place ",[],{"type":168,"text":181,"spans":182,"direction":69},"Accessibility features for our disabled customers to customise their delivery ",[],{"type":168,"text":184,"spans":185,"direction":69},"Up to three delivery attempts with no charge for a missed delivery ",[],{"type":168,"text":187,"spans":188,"direction":69},"£20 parcel cover completely free (excluding postable) ",[],{"dimensions":190,"alt":193,"copyright":44,"url":194,"id":195,"edit":196},{"width":191,"height":192},2000,1300,"View from the window of a house, an Evri courier is approaching and waving to a woman in the window. He is delivering a couple of parcels to the house.","saturday-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdE5bqstJ9-inh_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7995.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C70%2C8192%2C5325&w=2000&h=1300","Z6zdE5bqstJ9-inh",{"x":58,"y":197,"zoom":60,"background":61},70,"Check out our reviews to see why customers love us",{"id":200,"type":79,"tags":201,"lang":15,"slug":202,"first_publication_date":203,"last_publication_date":204,"uid":205,"url":206,"link_type":18,"key":207,"isBroken":20},"ZZbO2xEAACMAOqIv",[],"whats-new","2024-01-04T15:51:15+0000","2026-07-10T11:02:40+0000","evri-reviews","\u002Fevri-reviews","7360da39-81a2-4098-837f-6b04e3d91cff",{"link_type":118},"landing_feature_banner$d43059ac-8e21-4ed4-adc7-afc82452c7be","landing_feature_banner",{"variation":212,"version":25,"items":213,"primary":275,"id":284,"slice_type":150,"slice_label":44},"3Column",[214,235,255],{"Title":215,"Description":219,"Image":223,"Label":44,"UrlText":230,"Url":231,"buttonDataGtmTrack":44,"SecondaryButtonText":44,"SecondaryButtonUrl":234,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":44,"ShowAppDownloadCta":44},[216],{"type":101,"text":217,"spans":218,"direction":69},"Visit your local ParcelShop on a Saturday ",[],[220],{"type":66,"text":221,"spans":222,"direction":69},"You can find an Evri ParcelShop in over 9,000 stores across the country. With almost all open 7 days a week with long opening hours and free nearby parking, our ParcelShops are one of the most convenient ways to send a parcel on a Saturday. When you book online you can even print your parcel label in-store with one of our Print in ParcelShop devices.",[],{"dimensions":224,"alt":225,"copyright":44,"url":226,"id":227,"edit":228},{"width":52,"height":53},"ParcelShop store assistant is smiling and handing a blue receipt to the customer to confirm their parcel has been accepted.","saturday-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TI7pbqstJ9-TfZ_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2423.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=38%2C0%2C5923%2C3939&w=1000&h=665","Z6TI7pbqstJ9-TfZ",{"x":229,"y":58,"zoom":60,"background":61},38,"Visit your local ParcelShop",{"link_type":91,"key":232,"url":233},"124feda0-3a25-4a16-b461-e7adba8af9fd","saturday-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop",{"link_type":118},{"Title":236,"Description":240,"Image":244,"Label":44,"UrlText":251,"Url":252,"buttonDataGtmTrack":44,"SecondaryButtonText":44,"SecondaryButtonUrl":254,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":44,"ShowAppDownloadCta":44},[237],{"type":101,"text":238,"spans":239,"direction":69},"24\u002F7 Lockers in your neighbourhood ",[],[241],{"type":66,"text":242,"spans":243,"direction":69},"Safe, secure, and open 24\u002F7, you can find a parcel Locker in your neighbourhood ready to receive your parcels. Drop off at your nearest location any day of the week to get your parcel on the move with a seamless and automated experience.",[],{"dimensions":245,"alt":246,"copyright":44,"url":247,"id":248,"edit":249},{"width":52,"height":53},"Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out","saturday-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C17%2C8164%2C5429&w=1000&h=665","Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb",{"x":58,"y":250,"zoom":60,"background":61},17,"Find your nearest Locker",{"link_type":91,"key":253,"url":233},"d8bd4e05-9e9b-4596-acf8-f3abba6ea9ad",{"link_type":118},{"Title":256,"Description":260,"Image":264,"Label":44,"UrlText":270,"Url":271,"buttonDataGtmTrack":44,"SecondaryButtonText":44,"SecondaryButtonUrl":274,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":44,"ShowAppDownloadCta":44},[257],{"type":101,"text":258,"spans":259,"direction":69},"Courier collection straight from your door ",[],[261],{"type":66,"text":262,"spans":263,"direction":69},"Free up some of that precious Saturday time by sending a parcel without having to leave your home. Book a courier collection on a Saturday to have one of our friendly couriers come and collect your parcel straight from your doorstep.",[],{"dimensions":265,"alt":266,"copyright":44,"url":267,"id":268,"edit":269},{"width":52,"height":53},"A customer is handing an Evri Courier their parcel during a doorstep collection in a block of flats. The Courier is filling in the details of the collection on a blue slip to hand to the customer","saturday-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDlZbqstJ9-cfb_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4172.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6pDlZbqstJ9-cfb",{"x":58,"y":59,"zoom":60,"background":61},"Schedule a courier collection",{"link_type":91,"key":272,"url":273},"87c00ee7-b6b8-437b-95d5-7224dd7cd334","saturday-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":118},{"SectionTitle":276,"SectionDescription":280,"theme":44},[277],{"type":142,"text":278,"spans":279,"direction":69},"Three easy ways to arrange Saturday parcel collection and delivery ",[],[281],{"type":66,"text":282,"spans":283,"direction":69},"Deliver your parcels when it suits your customers with Evri’s Saturday delivery options: ",[],"article_link_module$67e6a267-20b8-4665-8b51-268935a2db64",{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":286,"primary":328,"id":330,"slice_type":331,"slice_label":44},[287,303,315],{"questionTitle":288,"questionBody":289},"Are Saturday deliveries limited to specific times or services?",[290,293],{"type":66,"text":291,"spans":292,"direction":69},"Our standard services remain exactly the same on Saturday.  ",[],{"type":66,"text":294,"spans":295,"direction":69},"The opening times of our ParcelShops do vary, however, so it’s worth checking before you head off to send your parcel. Use our ParcelShop finder for more information.  ",[296,301],{"start":297,"end":298,"type":76,"data":299},119,144,{"link_type":91,"url":233,"target":300},"_self",{"start":297,"end":302,"type":88},145,{"questionTitle":304,"questionBody":305},"Can I send an international parcel on a Saturday?",[306],{"type":66,"text":307,"spans":308,"direction":69},"Of course! Just drop off as you would normally at a ParcelShop, Locker, or with your local courier, and our weekend delivery team will get your international parcel across borders in no time. Send an international parcel this Saturday.  ",[309,314],{"start":310,"end":311,"type":76,"data":312},192,234,{"link_type":91,"url":313,"target":300},"saturday-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Finternational-send",{"start":310,"end":311,"type":88},{"questionTitle":316,"questionBody":317},"Can you change your delivery address if you’re going to be out?",[318],{"type":66,"text":319,"spans":320,"direction":69},"Yes, customers can change where a delivery is sent if they’re not going to be at home. This could be to a neighbour’s house, safe place, Locker or ParcelShop. It’s easy to track and divert packages online. Customers can simply enter their tracking number and choose from the options.",[321,327],{"start":322,"end":323,"type":76,"data":324},172,204,{"link_type":91,"url":325,"target":326},"saturday-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ftrack-a-parcel","_blank",{"start":322,"end":323,"type":88},{"title":329},"Frequently asked questions","frequently_asked_questions$81faf7e5-1a0d-40b4-a7cd-c58cc89cf812","frequently_asked_questions",[23,45,96,151,211,285],{"heroCardContent":334},[335],{"id":29,"uid":44,"url":44,"type":30,"href":336,"tags":337,"first_publication_date":33,"last_publication_date":34,"slugs":338,"linked_documents":339,"lang":15,"alternate_languages":340,"data":341},"saturday-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZgVcQRIAACEApjZD%22%29+%5D%5D",[],[32],[],[],{"monotypeTitle":342,"heading":351,"headingSupplement":352,"subheading":353,"promoText":354,"headingInternational":355,"headingSupplementInternational":44,"subheadingInternational":44,"promoTextInternational":356,"destination_countries":357,"quickLinks":365,"footerLinks":366,"footerLinksInternational":404,"name":416,"tabName":417,"tabDataGtmTrack":418},{"dimensions":343,"alt":346,"copyright":44,"url":347,"id":348,"edit":349},{"width":344,"height":345},88,24,"Monotype Evri Send Logo","saturday-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F2a1dcc38-ecf2-4a6a-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+%281%29.svg","ZcyF-hIAACgAGOcv",{"x":58,"y":58,"zoom":60,"background":350},"#fff","from £2.62","(£2.18 + VAT)","Pay less for UK parcels up to 15kg vs. Royal Mail Click & Drop**","SALE: Up to £1.27 off 0-2kg parcels​","a parcel internationally from £6.08","FREE end-to-end tracking with every parcel",{"link_type":358,"key":359,"kind":360,"id":361,"url":362,"name":363,"size":364},"Media","c39b504a-78d8-4278-8400-feef78f46686","file","ZVYf1hAAACYAGda4","saturday-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F75d3ec4a-c68e-41bf